            "type": "address"
          },
          {
            "doc": "",
            "name": "operator",
            "type": "address"
          }
        ],
        "outputs": []
      }
    },
    {
      "function_v0": {
        "doc": "Initializes a marketplace for one NFT collection and settlement asset.\\n\\n# Arguments\\n\\n* `e` - Contract execution environment.\\n* `config` - RBAC, NFT, settlement asset, treasury, and protocol fee configuration.\\n* `operator` - RBAC administrator authorizing construction.\\n\\n# Errors\\n\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::InvalidProtocolFee` when the fee exceeds the maximum.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::InvalidSettlementAsset` when settlement is not a\\ndeployed Stellar Asset Contract.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::InvalidTreasury` when the treasury is not a Wasm\\ncontract configured for the marketplace settlement asset.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::InvalidNft` when the NFT is not a Wasm contract\\ngoverned by the configured RBAC contract.\\n* Propagates authorization and role errors from the RBAC contract.",
        "name": "__constructor",
        "inputs": [
          {
            "doc": "",
            "name": "config",
            "type": {
              "udt": {
                "name": "MarketplaceConfig"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "doc": "",
            "name": "operator",
            "type": "address"
          }
        ],
        "outputs": []
      }
    },
    {
      "function_v0": {
        "doc": "Transfers an NFT into escrow and opens a sale at a fixed price.\\n\\n# Arguments\\n\\n* `e` - Contract execution environment.\\n* `seller` - Current NFT owner opening the sale.\\n* `contract_address` - Vanity contract address represented by the NFT.\\n* `price` - Positive settlement-asset amount requested from a buyer.\\n\\n# Errors\\n\\n* Fails when the marketplace is paused or `seller` does not authorize the invocation.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::InvalidPrice` when `price` is not positive.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::SaleAlreadyExists` when the address is already listed.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::ConfigNotFound` when configuration is unavailable.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::IncorrectOwner` when `seller` does not own the NFT.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::ClaimAddressMismatch` for an inconsistent NFT claim.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::InvalidSettlementRecipient` when the seller is not\\nauthorized to receive the settlement asset.\\n* Fails with `MarketplaceError::SaleNotFound` or\\n`MarketplaceError::SellerInde",
        "name": "place_for_sale",
        "inputs": [
          {
            "doc": "",
            "name": "seller",
            "type": "address"
          },
          {
            "doc": "",
            "name": "contract_address",
            "type": "address"
          },
          {
            "doc": "",
            "name": "price",
            "type": "i128"
          }
        ],
        "outputs": []
      }
    },
